{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2393"},"reason":"Sources disagree on the number of 1688 witnesses: 42 heard at the council of 22 October 1688 (after Rachel Weil, cited by the warming-pan article) versus 'over seventy witnesses' whose testimonies James published (James Francis Edward Stuart article, citing the ODNB). The answer 42 stays; the notes now record the other count.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warming-pan_scandal"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Francis_Edward_Stuart"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",13],["+"," Counts of the 1688 witnesses differ: the 42 people heard at the council of 22 October 1688 is the figure given after the historian Rachel Weil; other accounts speak of over seventy witnesses whose testimonies were published."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",13],["+"," Die Zahl der Zeugen von 1688 wird unterschiedlich angegeben: 42 vor dem Rat am 22. Oktober 1688 gehörte Personen nennt die Historikerin Rachel Weil; andere Darstellungen sprechen von über siebzig Zeugen, deren Aussagen veröffentlicht wurden."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",15],["+"," Число свидетелей 1688 года указывается по-разному: 42 человека, выслушанных на заседании совета 22 октября 1688 года, называет историк Рэйчел Вейл; в других источниках говорится о более чем семидесяти свидетелях, чьи показания были опубликованы."]]}],"hash":"a26657d700d9","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"10cb8d1e96d6349f02a3f878450b6cb8ef4bbffc365a5a42dd188e405584f789"},
